      "role": "historical_object",
      "atlasDecision": "NO_PRODUCTION_CASE",
      "chapterFunction": "Shochiku-era modernization and independent performer-producers such as Tsumasaburo Bando created different production and distribution models; genres and companies are institutional context rather than fake films."
    },
    {
      "label": "Shanghai studios, Mingxing/Minxin networks and urban Chinese modernity",
      "role": "historical_object",
      "atlasDecision": "NO_PRODUCTION_CASE",
      "chapterFunction": "Early Chinese production grew through rapidly changing companies, writers, performers and urban exhibition circuits; a tiny surviving corpus must not be mistaken for the whole industry."
    },
