      "label": "Wuxia serial culture, special effects, censorship and fragment survival",
      "role": "historical_object",
      "atlasDecision": "NO_PRODUCTION_CASE",
      "chapterFunction": "Late-1920s martial-arts serials could run across many installments and later face official bans; surviving fragments such as Red Heroine require explicit limits on what historians can reconstruct."
    },
