      "label": "Phalke, mythological production and early Indian studio formation",
      "role": "historical_object",
      "atlasDecision": "NO_PRODUCTION_CASE",
      "chapterFunction": "Indian silent production developed indigenous entrepreneurship, mythological genres and performance practices before sound; origin stories remain contextual history rather than a single founder preset."
